hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"217","[AI-translation] Allah ke naam se, tareef Allah ke liye hai. Pak woh jis ne hamare liye yeh musakhkhar kiya; hum is ki taqat na rakhte the; beshak apne Rab ki taraf lautne wale hain. Tareef Allah ke liye hai [teen bar]; Allah sab se bada hai [teen bar]. Tu pak hai ae Allah; apni jaan par zulm kiya; mujhe bakhsh de; tere siwa gunah koi nahin bakhshta. [Sawari par chadhkar padhe]"
